flowchart LR
  accTitle: Nightingale — AI interprets. Verified data decides.
  accDescr: Explicit user observations reach a deterministic route engine. Human-verified route data and validation determine progress. Session state is persisted; the phone presents bounded text, bird cues and accepted fixed speech. Audio transcription is a separate editable-draft flow.

  Input["PHONE / Firebase Hosting<br/>Typed text · confirmed transcript<br/>Photo · walker confirmation"]
  API["CLOUD RUN / Hono<br/>POST /api/sessions/:id/observations"]
  AI["VERTEX / Gemini 2.5 Flash<br/>Interpret text or photo<br/>Canonical observation"]
  Gate["SCHEMA + VALIDATOR<br/>Route vocabulary and guards<br/>Unknown evidence holds position"]
  Engine["DETERMINISTIC ENGINE<br/>Questions · recovery · arrival<br/>Atomic confirmation"]
  Output["PHONE / Validated response<br/>One next step + bird cue<br/>44 fixed Chinese WAVs"]
  Truth["HUMAN-VERIFIED ROUTE<br/>Renai checkpoint graph<br/>Entrance evidence"]
  Store[("FIRESTORE SESSION<br/>State · action · pending question<br/>Usage counts + expiry")]
  Zone["PHONE / Optional coarse zone<br/>Coordinates stay on the phone<br/>Zone alone cannot prove arrival"]

  Input --> API
  API -->|"text / photo"| AI --> Gate --> Engine --> Output
  API -->|"explicit confirmation"| Engine
  Truth --> Gate
  Truth --> Engine
  Zone -.->|"zone ID only"| Gate
  Engine <--> Store

  classDef truth fill:#dce9df,stroke:#355d47,stroke-width:2px
  classDef gate fill:#fff5db,stroke:#9a7840
  class Truth,Engine truth
  class Gate gate
